p;#10;It rained 25% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 61 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"320.65639344262286\" cy=\"292.4918032786885\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 86%&amp;#10;It rained 46% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 70 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"362.086\" cy=\"215.6\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 94%&amp;#10;It rained 59% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 54 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"392.1366666666666\" cy=\"166.2962962962963\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 100%&amp;#10;It rained 75% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 213 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"410.5042253521127\" cy=\"110.28169014084506\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(39%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In Ho Chi Minh City the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>autumn</b> (-0.08) and least in\n<b>spring</b> (-1.04).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>137</td><td class='num'>20%</td><td class='num'>-1.037</td><td class='num'>38.6%</td></tr><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>163</td><td class='num'>13%</td><td class='num'>-0.271</td><td class='num'>22.7%</td></tr><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>180</td><td class='num'>58%</td><td class='num'>-0.106</td><td class='num'>28.3%</td></tr><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>178</td><td class='num'>57%</td><td class='num'>-0.082</td><td class='num'>25.7%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":10.82302,"lon":106.62965,"n":658,"n_cities":213,"name":"Ho Chi Minh City","offset_days":0,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.04,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.005161290322580644,"n":62,"obs":0.0,"sig":false},{"hi":0.25,"lo":0.04,"mean":0.12250000000000003,"n":68,"obs":0.014705882352941176,"sig":true},{"hi":0.53,"lo":0.25,"mean":0.3863076923076923,"n":65,"obs":0.1076923076923077,"sig":true},{"hi":0.69,"lo":0.53,"mean":0.607076923076923,"n":65,"obs":0.13846153846153847,"sig":true},{"hi":0.8,"lo":0.69,"mean":0.7419672131147539,"n":61,"obs":0.2459016393442623,"sig":true},{"hi":0.92,"lo":0.8,"mean":0.859,"n":70,"obs":0.45714285714285713,"sig":true},{"hi":0.98,"lo":0.92,"mean":0.9438888888888888,"n":54,"obs":0.5925925925925926,"sig":true},{"hi":1.0,"lo":0.98,"mean":0.9957746478873241,"n":213,"obs":0.7464788732394366,"sig":true}],"prcp_km":21.5,"provisional":false,"rank":194,"rank_hi":201.0,"rank_lo":176.0,"reliability":0.10080306047330614,"resolution":0.08991294416302989,"skill_pct":null,"slug":"ho-chi-minh-city","station":"","timezone":"Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh"}